## Error Handling Rules
1. Never silently skip missing accounts - log warning and continue
2. Fail hard on balance validation errors
3. Provide actionable error messages with file/row context
4. Clean up temp files even on failure

## Testing Requirements
- Test with BOTH old (Q1 2019) and new (Q3 2025) BDO formats
- Verify schema drift detection with mock files
- Test covenant calculations against known values
- Integration test the full orchestrator

