## Common Pitfalls to Avoid
1. ❌ Using `pd.read_excel()` header=0 - headers may not be row 0
2. ❌ Hardcoding column indices - BDO changes format
3. ❌ Converting EUR to USD - All values are EUR
4. ❌ Using `xlwings` - Requires Excel installed, use openpyxl
5. ❌ Modifying original input files - Always copy first
6. ❌ Assuming dates are datetime - May be strings in Dutch format

## When Implementing
1. Read the full implementation plan document first
2. Start with BDO parser - it's the foundation
3. Write tests before complex transformations
4. Use dry-run mode for validation without file generation
5. Log everything with context (file, row, account code)
